  "part": {
    "name": "Pedestal-mounted fork bracket with threaded top boss",
    "description": "Single-piece mechanical mounting bracket comprising an elongated two-hole base plate, a thick asymmetric upright web with an open fork-like cavity, paired obround side pockets, a reduced-thickness upper head, a transverse locating hole, and a reinforced threaded boss on top. The STEP model is one solid with 67 B-rep faces and an overall bounding box of 168 x 180 x 60 mm.",
    "source_views": [
      "front",
      "back",
      "left",
      "right",
      "top",
      "bottom",
      "toprightiso",
      "STEP B-rep analysis report"
    ],
    "symmetry_note": "The base plate, top boss, transverse head hole, and paired side pockets are approximately symmetric about the thickness mid-plane z=-21 mm. The upright profile is strongly asymmetric along the base length because of the open fork cavity and curved load path. Front and back appearances are approximately mirrored."
  },
